  "bodyHash": "0344e28e7b24bbfc",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>Classics Reborn &amp; Cima's Classic Renovation Pack</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>经典重铸&amp;神梦的经典改造枪包</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>一个将旧TAC枪支带到TACZ的枪包，旨在带回那些怀旧的枪械。当然，未来也会增加一些你总是可以在电视、电影或游戏中看到的“经典”枪械。现在，所有这些经典枪械都会接受来自Cima Silchin的改造，让他们以不同的方式重生！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>此外，如果你喜欢我的作品，可以通过上方链接来找到和支持我！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.com%252fa%252fcima_warfare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://afdian.com/a/cima_warfare</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>在使用这个枪包之前，你需要下载这个模组作为前置：<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" rel=\"nofollow\">[TaCZ] Timeless and Classics Zero - Minecraft Mods - CurseForge</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;</strong></span></p>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">安装方法：</span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">(1.0.3 发布版本及更早版本)</span></strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">打开 .minecraft 文件夹，进入 “config/tacz/custom”，将 .zip 文件放入其中（无需解压），即可游玩。如果未生效，请尝试在游戏中输入命令 “/tacz reload”。</span></p>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">安装方法：</span><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">(1.1.4 发布版本及更高版本)</span></strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\">打开你的游戏版本文件夹，进入 “.minecraft/tacz”，将 .zip 文件放入其中（无需解压），即可游玩。如果未生效，请尝试在游戏中输入命令 “/tacz reload” 或 “/reload”。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">注意！为了使用包括下挂榴弹在内的一系列特殊功能，你需要下载此模组：<a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-arcana-timeless-and-classics-guns\" rel=\"nofollow\">TacZ:Arcana (Timeless and Classics Guns) - Minecraft Mods - CurseForge</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\">截图展示：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1079169/description_29d2cc2a-e641-4f22-83c4-dfdfc5fabcc1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"798\" height=\"449\"></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1079169/description_89c1a76e-901c-4a71-bd11-adebf11983a5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"849\" height=\"378\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_efb5fb6a-0e7b-43c0-a93b-330d27d9ce29.png\" alt=\"QBZ-191\" width=\"797\" height=\"700\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">QBZ-191</p>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1079169/description_54d99abe-4a9d-43cb-8e15-c54a435d6aec.png\" alt=\"mk18mod1\" width=\"847\" height=\"392\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">MK18MOD1</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_27a732ee-553b-47d4-ab38-2adeb63a8287.png\" alt=\"NGSW-R\" width=\"805\" height=\"746\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">XM7</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1079169/description_a07b86f0-5c1b-4623-aca5-a098e8edf0bd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"726\" height=\"657\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">QJB95-1 | Longbow</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1079169/description_6e43a881-8ee4-485d-9c9a-66638e408811.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"572\" height=\"472\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">MK47</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1079169/description_7f1b831b-cb2e-4968-9638-2d081e3d4c50.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"51\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">MG</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1079169/description_c8a997c4-a3db-4306-9844-66a850fbf0a5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"484\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">SMG</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1079169/description_3b9af73a-4285-4798-8a5c-b2e7051df59d.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Shotgun</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1079169/description_ee81fe97-42ce-4a1a-b4b8-16b2ff706718.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Pistol</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1079169/description_0db7b3a9-4a74-45be-902c-b7b1bca4b460.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Sniper Rifle</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1079169/description_2cfedc44-56a6-4f63-af05-77107fba8150.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Rifle</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">超过40把枪械供你游玩！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;&mdash;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
